import{_ as a,o as i,c as t,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 202 | Realm Backward-Slide and Repair Mechanism: Practice of the Causal Self-Discipline Axiom","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 202 | Realm Backward-Slide and Repair Mechanism: Practice of the Causal Self-Discipline Axiom","no":202,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Realm Backward-Slide","Repair Mechanism","Causal Self-Discipline","Karmic Law"],"related":["82-Time Retrospection Basic Principles","83-Observe-First-Then-Limited-Interference Guideline","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0202_模块1-境界倒退与修复机制-因果自律公理的实践.md","filePath":"en/0202_模块1-境界倒退与修复机制-因果自律公理的实践.md"}'),n={name:"en/0202_模块1-境界倒退与修复机制-因果自律公理的实践.md"};function o(s,e,l,d,c,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-202-realm-backward-slide-and-repair-mechanism-practice-of-the-causal-self-discipline-axiom" tabindex="-1">Entry 202 | Realm Backward-Slide and Repair Mechanism: Practice of the Causal Self-Discipline Axiom <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-202-realm-backward-slide-and-repair-mechanism-practice-of-the-causal-self-discipline-axiom" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 202 | Realm Backward-Slide and Repair Mechanism: Practice of the Causal Self-Discipline Axiom&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 82, 83, 19</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-you-can-be-repaired-after-falling-but-you-cannot-cheat-and-redo" tabindex="-1">Introduction: You can be repaired after falling, but you cannot cheat and redo <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-you-can-be-repaired-after-falling-but-you-cannot-cheat-and-redo" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: You can be repaired after falling, but you cannot cheat and redo&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultivation is not a straight line that only rises. Breakthrough failure, mind-state loss, karmic backlash, energy collapse — all may cause realm backward-slide. Old systems have almost only two attitudes toward backward-slide: either treating one as a permanent cripple and kicking them away; or forcibly pulling them back via &quot;devouring pills, seizing others&#39; foundations,&quot; essentially manufacturing new predation. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is <strong>repairable, but cheating forbidden</strong> — backward-slide can be healed, but cannot be one-click redone by disturbing karma and devouring others. This is precisely the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s practice at the individual level.</p><p>The six top-level axioms fully take position on backward-slide repair: the anti-predation axiom forbids repairing backward-slide via predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races acknowledges everyone&#39;s right to stand up again; the collective ascension axiom requires the repair process to deepen one&#39;s understanding of beings; the causal self-discipline axiom is this entry&#39;s protagonist — repair must respect karmic continuity, no historical reverse-driving; the law-first axiom requires the repair mechanism to be self-consistent, not via plot cheats of &quot;turning back time&quot;; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-common-causes-of-realm-backward-slide" tabindex="-1">I. Common Causes of Realm Backward-Slide <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-common-causes-of-realm-backward-slide" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Common Causes of Realm Backward-Slide&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Cause</th><th>Manifestation</th><th>Common Realm</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Forced breakthrough failure</td><td>Energy backlash, foundation damaged</td><td>Transform–Law bottleneck period</td></tr><tr><td>Mind-state loss</td><td>Taking shortcuts, greed arising</td><td>Around Dao Origin Realm</td></tr><tr><td>Karmic backlash</td><td>Overstepping to interfere with others&#39; karma</td><td>Boundary-Breaking Realm and above</td></tr><tr><td>Energy collapse</td><td>Domain collapse, law detachment</td><td>Dao Integration Realm and above</td></tr><tr><td>Predatory residual trace eruption</td><td>Old accounts settled</td><td>Mid-high ranks</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-causal-self-discipline-why-you-cannot-turn-back-time" tabindex="-1">II. Causal Self-Discipline: Why You Cannot &quot;Turn Back Time&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-causal-self-discipline-why-you-cannot-turn-back-time" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Causal Self-Discipline: Why You Cannot &quot;Turn Back Time&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old web novels commonly solve backward-slide via &quot;turning back time, doing it over&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s causal self-discipline axiom explicitly vetoes this. Per &quot;Time Retrospection Basic Principles&quot; (Document 82) and &quot;Observe-First-Then-Limited-Interference Guideline&quot; (Document 83):</p><ul><li>Time retrospection is only for observation and archaeology, not for individual fate-changing;</li><li>Return knowledge only, do not disturb karma;</li><li>Thoroughly eradicate &quot;reincarnation harvesting&quot; and &quot;historical reverse-driving.&quot;</li></ul><p>Thus if you have slid back, you have slid back; you cannot wipe away the mistake by rewinding time. What you can do is cultivate again with the lesson. This seems harsh, but is actually fair — otherwise strong ones with time retrospection ability could infinitely trial-and-error, and ordinary beings would never have fairness.</p><h2 id="iii-three-tier-repair-mechanism-plan" tabindex="-1">III. Three-Tier Repair Mechanism Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-three-tier-repair-mechanism-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Three-Tier Repair Mechanism Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Applicability</th><th>Repair Means</th><th>Ethical Boundary</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tier 1 repair</td><td>Energy backlash, foundation hidden injuries</td><td>Symbiotic medicine, Life Cycle System recuperation</td><td>Free, transparent</td></tr><tr><td>Tier 2 repair</td><td>Mind-state loss, path deviation</td><td>Mentor companionship, re-walking basics, community service</td><td>No forced brainwashing</td></tr><tr><td>Tier 3 repair</td><td>Karmic backlash, overstepping fault</td><td>Karmic settlement, compensation to victims, long-term observation</td><td>Per Anchor Court ruling</td></tr></tbody></table><p>All three tiers <strong>do not use predatory means</strong>. Repair energy comes from joint contracting and ecological cycles, not devouring others.</p><h2 id="iv-re-growth-of-backward-sliders" tabindex="-1">IV. Re-Growth of Backward-Sliders <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-re-growth-of-backward-sliders" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Re-Growth of Backward-Sliders&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou does not treat backward-sliders as cripples. One real backward-slide and repair is often a key lesson in mind-state maturation — Entry 186&#39;s Youth Supreme ordeal mechanism&#39;s &quot;bare-cultivation period without golden finger&quot; is precisely a deliberately designed mini backward-slide. Cultivators who have experienced falling and standing up again often have more stable foundations than those who walked a smooth road all the way. This is also why the Standards Committee does not discriminate against candidates &quot;with a backward-slide history but repaired,&quot; looking only at current substance.</p><h2 id="v-the-only-irreparable-hard-injury" tabindex="-1">V. The Only Irreparable Hard Injury <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-the-only-irreparable-hard-injury" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. The Only Irreparable Hard Injury&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The only irreparable one is confirmed predatory original sin — those who intentionally devour others&#39; origin or massively disturb karma; their backward-slide is not given a &quot;re-cultivation opportunity,&quot; but enters isolation and sanction procedures per law. This is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s rigid boundary: you can make a mistake, and institutions give you repair; but if you use harming others as a means to re-cultivate, institutions no longer give you another chance.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: backward-slide does not equal scrapping; three-tier repair rescues damaged cultivators&#39; potential</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: explicitly forbids cheating repair via predation, time-rewind, devouring others for foundation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style characters often rely on resurrection, body-seizure, rebirth cheats; Heng Yuan Zhou backward-sliders re-cultivate by themselves and institutions</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: three-tier repair faces all Myriad Races; consciousness races, mechanical races, etc., each have genealogy-specific healing plans</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: repair procedures, ethical boundaries, and karmic settlement standards are all public, referenceable by any civilization</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-network-backstop-for-backward-slide-repair" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Network Backstop for Backward-Slide Repair <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-network-backstop-for-backward-slide-repair" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Network Backstop for Backward-Slide Repair&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The realm backward-slide repair mechanism is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s practical manifestation in the Heng Yuan Zhou system. Backward-slide is not shameful; what is shameful is refusing to admit fault after backward-slide. The Alaya Network does not make punitive records when a cultivator backward-slides, but generates a backward-slide attribution report pointing out which karmic chain went wrong. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization provides backward-sliders with repair paths: returning to the previous realm&#39;s safe track, re-walking the broken law cognition. The law-first axiom requires repair to follow law not rely on resource stacking. The universal equal infinite law ensures backward-sliders are not permanently marked as &quot;losers&quot;; after repair, their historical records automatically clear.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s requirement on individuals is: after falling, you can be helped up, but you may not push others over to use as a stepping stone, nor may you turn back time to pretend you never fell. This &quot;no cheating&quot; is precisely Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s greatest respect for every person who has fallen.</p><p>In the final analysis, realm backward-slide and repair mechanism · practice of the causal self-discipline axiom described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./82-时间回溯基本原则.html">82-Time Retrospection Basic Principles</a> · <a href="./83-先观测后有限干涉准则.html">83-Observe-First-Then-Limited-Interference Guideline</a> · <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界.html">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const m=a(n,[["render",o]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
